{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le15ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le15ob05re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le15ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "To whom it may concern,<br/><br/>\nYou are supposed to be a fair editor, so I hope you will print my point of view. As a person who cares about the future of humankind, I feel a need to write this letter. We humans \u2013 as well as all the Earth's plants and animals \u2013 are creations of nature. What will happen if we tamper with nature? Who will right things if they go dramatically wrong?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "Whether you believe that life evolved over millions of years, or that it was created by a greater or divine being, it is still precious. Surely, then, it is unacceptable to approve of the experiments that are being carried out today by genetic engineers. If genetic engineering expands into gene transfer and recombination, it will create new viruses and bacteria.", "time": "24000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "These are viruses that are not supposed to exist. They could easily cause new epidemics. Even if we only meddle with nature in a minor way, it will certainly bring serious consequences. We are supposed to protect nature, not change it. We should think seriously before unwittingly creating problems.\n<br/><br/>\nIf we allow genetic engineers a free rein, where will it end? Playing with nature is like playing with fire. We should think carefully before we get badly burned!<br/><br/>\nSincerely,<br/><br/>\nA concerned citizen", "time": "48000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "When I finished school I really wanted to be a scientist.  I felt passionate about genetics and how engineers were capable of working on recombination and gene transfer. However, when I thought I was going to be a genetic engineer, my father told me I had to study business administration so that I could help him to work on his project. It was very sad but I couldn't refuse to help him!"}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology and subjects of study.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What problems do you think there could be in the future with things that are genetically modified?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How much do you worry about ingesting modified plants?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What is genetic engineering?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents"