 With Nature!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Should and Be Supposed To ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "   You use the modal <span class=\"strong\">should</span> or  the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> when you want to  talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the present or future that are expected to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + To be + supposed to + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm supposed to clean the house this afternoon.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**:<br/> When you say be <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Like this:<br/> Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You are supposed to be a fair editor, so I hope you will print my point of view.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "These are viruses that are not supposed to exist. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We are supposed to protect nature, not change it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We should think seriously before unwittingly creating problems.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We should think carefully before we get badly burned!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do   something. In that condition, something else will happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Main Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> If Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> What will happen </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> if we tamper with nature?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> What will happen </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> if they go dramatically wrong?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> We will cause devastating consequences</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> if we meddle with nature. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> If Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Main Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If genetic engineering expands into gene transfer and recombination,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> it will create new viruses and bacteria.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Even if we only meddle with nature in a minor way, </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">it will certainly bring serious consequences.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tamper", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to meddle, especially for the purpose of altering, damaging, or misusing ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What will happen if we tamper with nature?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about genetic engineering.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dramatically", "type": "name"}, {"content": "suddenly or \u200bobviously", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Who will right things if they go dramatically wrong?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to evolve", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to develop (a characteristic) by evolutionary processes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You may believe that life evolved over millions of years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "divine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "of or relating to a god, especially the supreme being", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Whether you believe that life evolved over millions of years, or that it was created by a greater or divine being, it is still precious. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "recombination", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the natural or artificial rearrangement of genetic material in living organisms or viruses", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  If genetic engineering expands into gene transfer and recombination, it will create new viruses and bacteria.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "epidemic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an outbreak of a contagious disease that spreads rapidly and widely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some virus could easily cause new epidemics.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to meddle", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to involve oneself in a matter without right or invitation; interfere officiously and unwantedly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Even if we only meddle with nature in a minor way, it will certainly bring serious consequences.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "unwittingly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without intention ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should think seriously before unwittingly creating problems.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a free rein", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unrestricted liberty of action or decision", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we allow genetic engineers a free rein, where will it end? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online to look at different viewpoints on genetic modification you agree with.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose some ideas that you agree with.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the ideas to write a letter to an editor. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain what you believe, and why.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your letter to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your ideas.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I look up information on genetic modification. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I choose ideas for a letter.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a letter to an editor on genetic modification.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my letter and discuss the ideas.", "type": "text"}]}]}